tasks.description:
MODIFY ONE EXISTING FILE: agents/scs001-orchestrator/run-pipeline.ts.

Add metrics logging after the report is saved. Changes required:

1. Add import at top: import { logPipelineMetric } from './metrics-logger';

2. After the line `writeFileSync(reportsDir + '/latest.json', JSON.stringify(report, null, 2));` (line 23), add:
   // Log metrics for dashboard trends
   try {
     logPipelineMetric(report);
     console.log('[Runner] Pipeline metrics logged');
   } catch (err) {
     console.error('[Runner] Metrics logging failed (non-fatal):', (err as Error).message);
   }

The metrics logging is non-fatal (try/catch) like the Telegram notification — pipeline must never fail because of logging.

Do NOT modify any other file.

FAIL CONDITIONS: (1) logPipelineMetric not called. (2) Not wrapped in try/catch. (3) Any file other than run-pipeline.ts modified.
